  "semantics": [
    "r:id is the existing stable sheet identity; numeric sheetId is not exposed as sheet.id.",
    "ST_Xstring decoding is one pass per original string or rich-text run; formula text is not ST_Xstring-decoded.",
    "Empty saved string is distinguishable from absent numeric cache, but supplies no nonempty searchable segment.",
    "No equals prefix, shared-formula expansion, recomputation, labels, formula attributes, or display generation.",
    "Each field and cell is a separate search segment.",
    "All counts and UTF-8 sizes computed from the handwritten segments only."
